T* (Executive Overview:) Tj
T* (Full-year revenue grew 4% year over year. However, profitability declined in Q3 2024.) Tj
T* (Gross margin fell from 41.8% in Q2 to 33.1% in Q3.) Tj
T* (Primary drivers identified by management:) Tj
T* (1\) Cloud infrastructure costs rose 35% due to an unplanned migration and over-provisioning.) Tj
T* (2\) Professional services spend increased 35% for emergency implementation support.) Tj
T* (3\) SMB customer churn spiked to 22% in Q3, driven mainly by onboarding friction and support response times.) Tj
T* (Marketing spend was elevated but delivered flat pipeline, reducing ROI.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Outlook:) Tj
T* (Management has launched a cost-discipline program and an onboarding overhaul targeting Q4 recovery.) Tj
T* (Risk factors include competitive pricing pressure and lingering infrastructure inefficiencies.) Tj
